      "id": "claim_85d21c6e76354f61b418661763d40524",
      "statement": "Model profiles are generated from models.dev via the langchain-model-profiles CLI tool and stored in data/_profiles.py with provider-specific capability data (context window, modalities, tool calling, structured output). Profile augmentations can override or extend profiles via profile_augmentations.toml.",
