      "id": "claim_e28b9a02283c4117bd1f26410f1d976d",
      "statement": "Chat model providers must implement unit and integration tests by inheriting ChatModelUnitTests and ChatModelIntegrationTests from langchain-tests. The chat_model_class fixture provides the model class to test; additional configurable fixtures include chat_model_params, chat_model_has_tool_calling, and chat_model_has_structured_output.",
