    {
      "id": "claim_a7fa4aec0f874ffaa86e9395f1870be7",
      "statement": "Provider packages reside in /libs/partners/provider_name/ with a langchain_provider_name module containing chat_models/base.py (or chat_models.py at module root), data/ with profiles and augmentations, tests/ for unit and integration tests, and standard files: pyproject.toml, Makefile, README, LICENSE, uv.lock. The pyproject.toml specifies langchain-core>=1.6.2,<2.0.0, provider SDK dependencies with pinned versions (e.g., openai>=2.45.0,<4.0.0, anthropic>=0.120.0,<2.0.0), and test dependencies including langchain-tests>=1.1.9,<2.0.0 with version constraints. Local packages are referenced via [tool.uv.sources].",
