    {
      "id": "claim_b0af652f582b43798af20375ffc9de60",
      "statement": "Provider implementations must convert provider-specific response formats back to unified AIMessage. The conversion process involves: parsing the provider response structure, mapping provider content types to unified blocks, extracting and normalizing tool calls into ToolCall objects, populating usage_metadata (input/output token counts), and storing provider-specific fields in response_metadata. This is the reverse of input message conversion and ensures consistent output regardless of underlying provider API format.",
